# runtime-validation/prowler/.gitkeep
# =============================================================================
# This directory is reserved for future Prowler runtime validation integration.
#
# Future contents:
#   - Custom Prowler check configurations
#   - Prowler compliance framework mappings (CIS, NIST, SOC2)
#   - Prowler severity override configurations
#   - Prowler output templates
#
# Prowler will be run against the AWS sandbox environment after deployment,
# targeting the specific resources deployed by the current upload_id.
#
# Commands (future):
#   prowler aws \
#     --output-formats json \
#     --output-directory reports/runtime/ \
#     --severity critical high medium \
#     --tags upload_id=TF-UPLOAD-<UUID>
# =============================================================================
